WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.690
DATE_TRUNC changes the analytical grain of a
timestamp A

00:00:05.703 --> 00:00:12.276
timestamp can be truncated to day week month quarter
or other levels The

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:18.619
returned value represents the start of that period
This makes DATE_TRUNC

00:00:18.646 --> 00:00:23.185
especially useful for GROUP BY because all
timestamps in the same period receive the same

00:00:23.198 --> 00:00:24.027
bucket value
